                                      :RegularizationOnANOVA ,
                                      :RegularizationOnValueFairness ,
                                      :UserItemReRanking ;
        resource:SIO_000068 :EU_AI_Act ;
        rdfs:comment "Specifies additional obligations for deployers of high-risk AI systems, including using systems in accordance with instructions and monitoring operation, especially where decisions significantly affect individuals. Notes: Art. 26 is deployer-side operational compliance: implement monitoring KPIs (parity/error gaps/drift/consistency), define thresholds and escalation, apply workflow interventions and (where applicable) corrective controls directly or via provider coordination; evidence effectiveness through improvements in the monitored metrics." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.27
:Art.27 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                 :LegalRequirement ,
                 :ManagementLegalRequirement ;
        :isOperationalizedBy :Calibration ,
                             :ConditionalStatisticalParity ,
                             :CounterfactualFairness ,
                             :DemographicParity ,
                             :EqualOpportunity ,
                             :EqualizedOdds ,
                             :FairnessThroughAwareness ,
                             :IndividualFairness ,
                             :MatchingConditionalFrequencies ,
                             :StatisticalParity ,
                             :TestFairness ;
        :itsComplianceIsSupportedWith :AddNonToxicExamples ,
