                                      :RegularizationOnValueFairness ,
                                      :UserItemReRanking ;
        resource:SIO_000068 :EU_AI_Act ;
        rdfs:comment "Requires deployers of certain high-risk AI systems to perform a fundamental rights impact assessment (FRIA), identifying and evaluating risks to fundamental rights, including discrimination, and defining mitigation measures. Notes: Art. 27 is an ex-ante governance activity: select applicable fairness notions, compute risk indicators, set decision thresholds and escalation, define mitigations and verify effectiveness via the same mapped metrics; update FRIA when context or system version changes." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.29
:Art.29 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                 :LegalRequirement ,
                 :ManagementLegalRequirement ;
