                                      :LogLikeDocumentRemoval ,
                                      :NamesIntervention ,
                                      :PoliteAlternatives ,
                                      :REALTOXICITYPROMPTS ,
                                      :ReplaceStereotypes ;
        resource:SIO_000068 :EU_AI_Act ;
        rdfs:comment "Introduces specific transparency obligations for certain AI systems, such as those interacting with humans or detecting emotions, requiring users to be informed that they are interacting with AI. Notes: Renumbered to Art. 50 to match Regulation (EU) 2024/1689; transparency obligations mapped as operational control and risk-indicator support for discrimination detection." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.53
