        rdfs:comment "Sets out obligations for providers of general-purpose AI models, including documentation, information on training data, and risk management for systemic risks such as discrimination. Notes: Art. 53 maps notions/metrics as documentation evidence (evaluation protocols and results) and techniques as documentable controls whose configuration/limits must be communicated to downstream providers." .


