###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.71
:Art.71 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                 :LegalRequirement ,
                 :ManagementLegalRequirement ;
        :isOperationalizedBy :Calibration ,
                             :CounterfactualFairness ,
                             :DemographicParity ,
                             :EqualOpportunity ,
